WEBVTT

00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:22.440
Gisey... Gisey...

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:26.861
If you don't say something...

00:00:28.404 --> 00:00:30.907
...I'm gonna come in!

00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:45.713
Fan'!

00:00:45.963 --> 00:00:49.717
Fam! Fam!

00:00:49.967 --> 00:00:51.719
Are you okay?!

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:54.972
Yeah... I'm wide awake now!

00:00:55.223 --> 00:00:59.227
Check this out, Gisey!
I can almost grab the clouds!

00:00:59.477 --> 00:01:03.439
--How many times is that now?
--Six, maybe seven this month?

00:01:03.689 --> 00:01:06.734
Enjoy hanging there forever, Birdbrain!

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:10.112
What? No way! You can't be serious!

00:01:11.239 --> 00:01:17.828
<i>No matter what might await us there</i>

00:01:18.079 --> 00:01:26.504
<i>I'll go to unexplored territory with you</i>

00:01:34.762 --> 00:01:42.812
<i>I just had a short dream</i>

00:01:43.062 --> 00:01:47.441
<i>In it, I saw your back</i>

00:01:47.692 --> 00:01:53.614
<i>Was it the past? The future?</i>

00:01:53.864 --> 00:02:04.375
<i>Ignore the needle on that meter
pointing to the red zone</i>

00:02:04.625 --> 00:02:07.503
<i>And go where the tailwinds
and your feelings point you</i>

00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:13.676
<i>Every time I flap my wings, it makes me realize</i>

00:02:13.926 --> 00:02:19.223
<i>That there are skies
I'll never be able to see again</i>

00:02:19.473 --> 00:02:24.729
<i>But if you still want to take flight</i>

00:02:24.979 --> 00:02:31.527
<i>Then I will be your wings</i>

00:02:53.299 --> 00:02:56.135
Distance to capture site, 120.
Maintaining course.

00:02:56.385 --> 00:03:00.056
It's only calm on the surface.
The target is being drifted.

00:03:00.306 --> 00:03:03.100
Adjust heading 3 degrees starboard.

00:03:04.352 --> 00:03:05.811
A spout!

00:03:07.563 --> 00:03:08.356
A tail slap!

00:03:08.606 --> 00:03:11.317
She's just confirmed her own position!
She's going back down!

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:15.029
We're gonna intercept her and stop
her in her tracks! Gimme 20, Gisey!

00:03:15.279 --> 00:03:17.490
20 ticks! Roger!

00:03:28.542 --> 00:03:32.546
--Hey! You need to head out too!
--P It's your birthday! Be happy! <i>P</i>

00:03:32.797 --> 00:03:37.593
P You're born, you live,
and back to dust you go! <i>P</i>

00:03:42.598 --> 00:03:43.933
You're not going anywhere!

00:03:44.183 --> 00:03:46.435
The first harpoon is mine!

00:03:46.685 --> 00:03:49.063
<i>Go'.!</i>

00:04:00.366 --> 00:04:04.328
Claudia rotor has stopped! Thrust down 50%!

00:04:04.578 --> 00:04:10.042
What are you doing?! Now I'm going
to be late for Mother's celebration!

00:04:10.292 --> 00:04:12.711
Signal light spotted ahead! Reads as follows!

00:04:12.962 --> 00:04:15.714
"Hey, you creepy pervert of a captain..."

00:04:15.965 --> 00:04:17.800
Creepy pervert?!

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:22.847
"Only a real coward would
turn tail and run now..."?!

00:04:23.097 --> 00:04:26.100
"I'm gonna make sure every port in the world

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:31.230
hears about how much of a chicken you are..."

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:32.565
"Hope you enjoy it!"

00:04:32.815 --> 00:04:37.194
--Wow, that's harsh, Gisey!
--But it was your idea, Fam...

00:04:38.404 --> 00:04:42.032
Lousy Sky Pirates! Shoot down that Vespa!

00:04:53.461 --> 00:04:54.920
Here they come!

00:05:02.052 --> 00:05:03.971
--Five.
--Four.

00:05:04.221 --> 00:05:05.806
--Three.
--Two.

00:05:06.056 --> 00:05:08.267
--One!
--Breach!

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:34.585
We've caught ourselves a Sky-Fish!

00:05:45.471 --> 00:05:48.015
--Dad!
--Sheesh...

00:05:48.265 --> 00:05:49.350
Signal from Pam's ship!

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.393
--Read it.
--Right.

00:05:51.644 --> 00:05:55.397
"You brainless oaf!
Don't go scuffing up my prey!"

00:05:55.648 --> 00:05:58.150
--Th-That's all.
--She sure is harsh...

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.861
Yeah. She's always like that.

00:06:07.785 --> 00:06:11.956
Ah. So you've returned, too.

00:06:12.206 --> 00:06:16.043
"The place where all are born
and where all will return.

00:06:16.293 --> 00:06:18.462
A blue world."

00:06:51.203 --> 00:06:56.041
O, Grand Lake, everlasting
water of righteousness.

00:06:56.292 --> 00:07:00.713
We, the people of Turan,
are thankful for your graciousness

00:07:00.963 --> 00:07:03.966
and offer you a prayer.

00:07:04.216 --> 00:07:08.178
We ask that you bless
the water, earth, and wind,

00:07:08.429 --> 00:07:11.807
so that we may receive their great bounty.

00:07:23.944 --> 00:07:25.571
Sister!

00:07:28.616 --> 00:07:32.369
Oh, Millia. Your dress is going to be drenched.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.372
To be soaked in the sacred
water of the Grand Lake

00:07:35.623 --> 00:07:37.791
is to receive its blessing!

00:07:38.042 --> 00:07:42.254
Princess Lily! Princess Millia! Your feet...!

00:07:44.214 --> 00:07:46.342
Oww...

00:07:50.346 --> 00:07:52.473
Teddy! You're unbelievable!

00:07:52.723 --> 00:07:55.392
P-Please forgive me, Princess Millia...!

00:07:55.643 --> 00:07:58.646
If you consider yourself a
servant to a Turan princess,

00:07:58.896 --> 00:08:00.147
then get your act together!

00:08:00.397 --> 00:08:02.232
Y-Y Q s!

00:08:07.363 --> 00:08:10.532
Oh? I thought you didn't mind being soaked

00:08:10.783 --> 00:08:12.534
in the sacred water of the Grand Lake?

00:08:12.785 --> 00:08:15.954
Th-This is different.

00:08:23.379 --> 00:08:26.423
It's always so peaceful here...

00:08:27.466 --> 00:08:29.134
So beautiful...

00:08:31.303 --> 00:08:34.223
Even the Ades Federation
views this place as sacred,

00:08:34.473 --> 00:08:38.143
despite plotting to usurp
basically everything else.

00:08:38.394 --> 00:08:41.397
There surely must be a sinister side
to our upcoming peace treaty!

00:08:41.647 --> 00:08:42.398
Millia.

00:08:42.648 --> 00:08:45.484
But, think about it!
So many people have perished!

00:08:45.734 --> 00:08:47.486
All because of them...!

00:08:59.623 --> 00:09:02.126
It's time. Let's go.

00:09:14.722 --> 00:09:17.391
--Fam! You're back!
--Yep!

00:09:17.641 --> 00:09:19.059
Welcome home, Sis!

00:09:19.309 --> 00:09:21.729
We're back! I'll get cooking right away!

00:09:21.979 --> 00:09:23.272
Hurray! Fam!

00:09:23.522 --> 00:09:25.107
I'm back, Adele!

00:09:25.357 --> 00:09:27.484
Did you get the first harpoon again today, Fam?

00:09:27.735 --> 00:09:29.695
You betcha!

00:09:29.945 --> 00:09:31.196
Your stomach...

00:09:31.447 --> 00:09:34.241
--Potato pancakes okay?
--Sounds great!

00:09:34.491 --> 00:09:35.951
Ah...

00:09:37.411 --> 00:09:38.203
Die!

00:09:38.454 --> 00:09:40.289
You ditched work again!

00:09:40.539 --> 00:09:42.624
You were amazing out there, Fam!

00:09:42.875 --> 00:09:44.710
Zoom!

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:46.211
Vroom!

00:09:46.462 --> 00:09:47.337
Bang!

00:09:47.588 --> 00:09:48.547
Listen, you!

00:09:48.797 --> 00:09:51.508
If you're gonna mooch off us,
do some work for a change!

00:09:51.759 --> 00:09:53.135
Yeah, do some work!

00:09:53.385 --> 00:09:54.511
Okay...

00:09:54.762 --> 00:09:56.764
Hey! Mean it when you say it!

00:09:58.974 --> 00:10:01.185
I wouldn't fill up on water just yet.

00:10:01.435 --> 00:10:04.521
You're going to have a busy day today!

00:10:05.814 --> 00:10:07.858
You have work, Fam?

00:10:10.569 --> 00:10:12.529
Remind me, what's our schedule today?

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:16.325
We caught that Skyfish, so we
have the rest of the day off.

00:10:16.575 --> 00:10:20.454
Tomorrow we have laundry and
potato-planting duty, though.

00:10:20.704 --> 00:10:22.915
Yeah, that's what I thought.

00:10:23.165 --> 00:10:24.708
All right!

00:10:25.793 --> 00:10:30.214
"Turan Kingdom and Ades Federation
to finalize peace treaty.

00:10:30.464 --> 00:10:34.551
The signing ceremony will take place
at noon today by the Grand Lake..."

00:10:34.802 --> 00:10:37.763
Hopefully this will end the
Federation's invasions for a while

00:10:38.013 --> 00:10:39.890
and make things more peaceful.

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:45.729
Say, isn't Turan being run by two
princesses while the king is sick?

00:10:45.979 --> 00:10:46.855
That's right.

00:10:47.105 --> 00:10:50.776
In fact, the younger one,
Princess Millia, is the same age as us!

00:10:51.026 --> 00:10:55.447
Amazing, don't you think?
To be so smart and beautiful...

00:10:55.697 --> 00:10:59.243
Definitely not for me. Sounds
too restrictive and demanding.

00:10:59.493 --> 00:11:04.540
Don't worry. You'd be the last
person to ever be a princess!

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:07.501
--Sheesh! What's that supposed to mean?!
--Sorry! Sorry!

00:11:12.923 --> 00:11:15.259
So many "Skyfish"...!

00:11:16.802 --> 00:11:18.846
135 miles west...!

00:11:19.096 --> 00:11:20.138
The Grand Lake?!

00:11:20.389 --> 00:11:22.724
What happened to the peace conference?

00:11:22.975 --> 00:11:25.185
We're taking first harpoon, Gisey!

00:11:25.435 --> 00:11:26.895
Right.

00:11:35.153 --> 00:11:37.197
Fam! May the wind carry your wings!

00:11:37.447 --> 00:11:38.782
Just leave it to me!

00:11:39.032 --> 00:11:40.951
Good tailwinds!

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:51.837
Where could he be?

00:11:52.087 --> 00:11:53.881
Maybe he overslept?

00:11:54.131 --> 00:11:55.924
N-No, of course not!

00:11:56.174 --> 00:11:57.384
Listen, Teddy.

00:11:57.634 --> 00:11:59.803
Don't confuse Premier Luscinia
of the Ades Federation

00:12:00.053 --> 00:12:01.388
for someone like you.

00:12:01.638 --> 00:12:03.932
L-I'm sorry!

00:12:20.657 --> 00:12:22.951
Here. Take my hand.

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:30.292
Sister! Sister!

00:12:30.542 --> 00:12:32.002
Sister!

00:12:37.299 --> 00:12:39.009
The blue sky has been blotted out...!

00:12:39.259 --> 00:12:41.094
P-Princess Millia!

00:12:41.345 --> 00:12:46.391
The Federation reveres the Grand Lake
as precious, sacred ground too.

00:12:46.642 --> 00:12:49.895
It would never go to war here, in this land.

00:12:50.145 --> 00:12:53.774
--But...!
--We are here to hold a mutual dialogue.

00:12:55.484 --> 00:12:57.653
There is no room for negotiation.

00:12:57.903 --> 00:13:03.158
The Ades Federation hereby
declares war on the Turan Kingdom.

00:13:04.409 --> 00:13:06.370
All forces, proceed without hesitation.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.413
Gloria!

00:13:08.664 --> 00:13:10.916
To the royal city of Turan, lglasia!

00:13:11.166 --> 00:13:15.629
Gloria! Gloria! Gloria! Gloria!

00:13:15.879 --> 00:13:20.425
Gloria! Gloria! Gloria! Gloria!...

00:13:34.314 --> 00:13:35.774
Why are they starting a war?!

00:13:36.024 --> 00:13:38.026
The Federation has betrayed Turan!

00:13:38.276 --> 00:13:40.529
The peace talks were a sham! Unforgivable!

00:13:40.779 --> 00:13:42.823
Gisey! Look!

00:13:43.073 --> 00:13:44.908
"The Winged Maiden"...

00:13:45.158 --> 00:13:47.703
Turan's flagship, the Lasas!

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:50.372
Take the two princesses alive!

00:13:50.622 --> 00:13:53.166
Kill all the rest!

00:14:04.386 --> 00:14:07.347
Gisey! Ready a signal tube and signal flares!

00:14:07.597 --> 00:14:08.598
What's the message?!

00:14:08.849 --> 00:14:12.686
The target is the Turan flagship.
Seven blues and five blacks.

00:14:12.936 --> 00:14:13.895
Are you serious?!

00:14:14.146 --> 00:14:17.399
I've made up my mind!
I'm going to steal that ship!

00:14:17.649 --> 00:14:19.985
Multiple Vanships detected!

00:14:20.235 --> 00:14:23.739
Lousy Sky Pirates... Already
swarming the place, are you?!

00:14:27.242 --> 00:14:28.744
First harpoon!

00:14:37.044 --> 00:14:40.547
Light signal from what appears
to be a Sky Pirate Vanship!

00:14:41.673 --> 00:14:44.676
"We shall now commandeer your flagship

00:14:44.926 --> 00:14:47.596
and take her from this battlefield."

00:14:47.846 --> 00:14:50.515
--Huh?!
--They're going to help us escape...

00:14:50.766 --> 00:14:52.184
...in exchange for the Lasas?!

00:14:52.434 --> 00:14:54.603
That's nonsense! Sky Pirate scum!

00:14:54.853 --> 00:15:01.568
"The choice is yours. Die here,
or survive with us Sky Pirates."

00:15:02.903 --> 00:15:06.698
Response signal!
Three short, one long, two short!

00:15:06.948 --> 00:15:08.450
Are you serious, Sister?!

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:12.621
Who will protect Turan
should we meet our end here?!

00:15:14.122 --> 00:15:15.582
--Fam.
“She's all yours.

00:15:15.832 --> 00:15:17.292
You can count on me!

00:15:18.335 --> 00:15:19.711
The Lasas is giving the OK!

00:15:19.961 --> 00:15:22.506
I love people who understand the situation!

00:15:28.595 --> 00:15:30.180
A <i>girl?</i>

00:15:37.145 --> 00:15:38.939
Okay! It's a done deal!

00:15:43.652 --> 00:15:45.278
She's good.

00:15:45.529 --> 00:15:47.489
Do you think she'll do what you say?

00:15:47.739 --> 00:15:50.617
--She'll pull through for us!
--Right!

00:15:55.705 --> 00:15:57.707
Seven blues, five blacks?!

00:15:57.958 --> 00:16:03.088
Man! That Birdbrain just
gets crazier and crazier!

00:16:03.338 --> 00:16:06.967
Fam sure loves to go for the big hauls!

00:16:07.217 --> 00:16:09.302
--Let's go!
--May the wind carry your wings!

00:16:09.553 --> 00:16:10.887
Good tailwinds!

00:16:11.138 --> 00:16:12.556
Let's do it!

00:16:12.806 --> 00:16:14.349
Yeah!

00:16:15.725 --> 00:16:18.145
The law of the sky says the
First Harpoon calls the shots.

00:16:18.395 --> 00:16:21.273
Make preparations, men! We're going hunting!

00:16:21.523 --> 00:16:23.358
Right! Good tailwinds!

00:16:23.608 --> 00:16:26.153
Atamora! Open the hatch!

00:16:31.032 --> 00:16:34.119
Now, then. How shall I amuse myself?

00:16:35.787 --> 00:16:37.497
Zoom!

00:16:39.583 --> 00:16:43.420
W-We can't do this!

00:16:45.213 --> 00:16:47.841
Commence countdown on blue signal light!

00:16:48.091 --> 00:16:50.093
All hands, prepare to strap in!

00:16:50.343 --> 00:16:51.845
S-Sister?!

00:16:52.095 --> 00:16:54.806
Okay, guys! Let's stir 'em up our usual way!

00:16:55.056 --> 00:16:56.766
Roger that, First Harpoon!

00:16:57.017 --> 00:16:58.310
Whatever you say!

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:00.562
Fan'!

00:17:00.812 --> 00:17:01.897
Die!

00:17:02.147 --> 00:17:03.064
Good tailwinds!

00:17:03.315 --> 00:17:06.693
Hey! I had the first harpoon, you know!

00:17:22.709 --> 00:17:25.670
Could the Sky Pirates have
teamed up with Turan?!

00:17:25.921 --> 00:17:30.300
Forget about them. There's no
escape from this siege net.

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:32.052
Confirm all ships' positions!

00:17:32.302 --> 00:17:35.889
Have them cease all activities
and follow the flagship's signals!

00:17:36.139 --> 00:17:37.599
Aye. Sir!

00:17:41.186 --> 00:17:44.022
Immelmann Turn!

00:17:46.691 --> 00:17:48.235
Amazing...

00:17:48.485 --> 00:17:50.862
That's nothing! I could do that too!

00:17:54.741 --> 00:17:57.160
We can't see a thing now!

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:58.828
Guide signal from the flagship!

00:17:59.079 --> 00:18:02.832
"SB-15. All ships, commence
fire on yellow signal light."

00:18:03.083 --> 00:18:06.169
All right! 15 to starboard! Prepare to fire!

00:18:06.419 --> 00:18:08.296
15 to starboard!

00:18:08.546 --> 00:18:10.048
Fire!

00:18:15.387 --> 00:18:17.514
Heavy damage to Ships #3
and #4 of the 2nd Squadron!

00:18:17.764 --> 00:18:19.516
Extensive damage to 3rd Squadron as well!

00:18:19.766 --> 00:18:23.061
Curse you, Sky Pirates!
Using our own signals against us...!

00:18:24.104 --> 00:18:27.649
"45 degrees left! 10 degrees
elevation! Range, 38,000!"

00:18:27.899 --> 00:18:29.609
All guns, fire!

00:18:31.444 --> 00:18:36.908
"Consort ship at SB-25!
Request fire at P-15 on white signal!"

00:18:45.375 --> 00:18:46.668
We might actually win now!

00:18:46.918 --> 00:18:48.128
This is insane!

00:18:48.378 --> 00:18:50.463
Dead slow ahead through the smoke.

00:18:50.714 --> 00:18:54.718
Stand by for next signal upon
arrival at coordinates W05.

00:18:54.968 --> 00:18:59.097
Emergency signal flares to all ships!
Don't be fooled by false signals!

00:18:59.347 --> 00:19:01.016
Ship #6 rapidly approaching!

00:19:01.266 --> 00:19:02.309
She's attacking head-on!

00:19:02.559 --> 00:19:06.354
And you people call yourselves
soldiers of the Augusta?!

00:19:06.604 --> 00:19:09.691
Claudia engines 3 through 6 are down!
Main rudder damaged!

00:19:09.941 --> 00:19:13.862
Damage to armor plating
in sections 25 through 41!

00:19:20.285 --> 00:19:22.370
Direction, 11 o'clock! Distance, 3 miles!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:25.457
Lasas located above lake! Elevation, 500!

00:19:25.707 --> 00:19:27.876
All ships, open fire!

00:19:32.213 --> 00:19:34.007
Blue signal spotted!

00:19:34.257 --> 00:19:35.258
Commence countdown!

00:19:35.508 --> 00:19:37.677
All hands, fasten in!

00:19:37.927 --> 00:19:41.473
--Sister!
--Hello!

00:19:41.723 --> 00:19:45.810
Okay! You guys should probably
hold on to something now!

00:19:46.061 --> 00:19:47.145
Wh-what are you...?!

00:19:47.395 --> 00:19:48.730
Here we go!

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:51.024
Spin!

00:19:53.985 --> 00:19:56.821
Clear #4 depth charge
and every last smoke bomb!

00:19:57.072 --> 00:19:58.573
Fire everything!

00:19:59.991 --> 00:20:01.868
You don't give the orders around here!

00:20:02.118 --> 00:20:05.622
Sophia and your king said
I could do whatever I want!

00:20:05.872 --> 00:20:07.791
That's nonsense!

00:20:22.055 --> 00:20:24.140
Full power to main thrusters!

00:20:27.394 --> 00:20:30.522
Now let's blow off the top-wing!

00:20:44.077 --> 00:20:47.705
Th-They scuttled their ship?!

00:20:50.917 --> 00:20:54.045
Report from Viceroy Kayvin of the 2nd Fleet.

00:20:54.295 --> 00:20:58.007
The Turan flagship Lasas has crashed
into the Grand Lake of her own accord

00:20:58.258 --> 00:20:59.801
and is now completely submerged.

00:21:00.051 --> 00:21:02.470
He believes that Princess Liliana
and Princess Millia

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:06.099
have met the same fate as their ship.

00:21:07.225 --> 00:21:10.395
What do you think, Alauda?

00:21:10.645 --> 00:21:14.315
I am your servant, Premier Luscinia.

00:21:14.566 --> 00:21:17.735
So, you only believe what you see for yourself?

00:21:17.986 --> 00:21:19.529
Yes.

00:21:26.411 --> 00:21:28.496
That was a brilliant strategy.

00:21:28.746 --> 00:21:32.667
For all of Turan, I offer you
the utmost gratitude.

00:21:32.917 --> 00:21:35.462
If anyone, you should praise
the people on the Lasas.

00:21:35.712 --> 00:21:38.965
They cast off all her beautiful wings for us.

00:21:39.215 --> 00:21:40.842
My sister might not have any qualms,

00:21:41.092 --> 00:21:43.636
but I refuse to accept this nonsense!

00:21:43.887 --> 00:21:45.013
I don't care.

00:21:45.263 --> 00:21:47.891
I didn't think up this plan. Fam did.

00:21:48.141 --> 00:21:48.933
<i>F am?</i>

00:21:49.184 --> 00:21:52.645
Wow! Check it out! Real-life princesses!

00:21:52.896 --> 00:21:54.814
I know! I'll get their autographs for you, Gisey!

00:21:55.064 --> 00:21:56.858
No, Fam! D-Don't...!

00:21:57.108 --> 00:21:58.735
Huh? What's the problem?

00:21:58.985 --> 00:22:02.614
Wh-Who are you?! Where are your manners?!

00:22:05.492 --> 00:22:07.619
Who is this girl?

00:22:07.869 --> 00:22:11.956
As we speak, Luscinia's fleet
of ships draws ever nearer

00:22:12.207 --> 00:22:15.001
to our beloved Turan Kingdom.

00:22:15.251 --> 00:22:17.045
We've no time to waste.

00:22:17.295 --> 00:22:19.797
Begin ship inspections and repairs at once!

00:22:20.048 --> 00:22:22.884
As soon as we're done, we're taking
the remainder of our fleet

00:22:23.134 --> 00:22:25.261
to the royal city of lglasia!

00:22:25.512 --> 00:22:29.557
We're going after Premier Luscinia
Hifez of the Ades Federation!

00:22:30.892 --> 00:22:36.481
<i>How high are the skies,</i>

00:22:36.731 --> 00:22:42.529
<i>how strong are the winds,</i>

00:22:42.779 --> 00:22:48.368
<i>how clear are the waters</i>

00:22:48.618 --> 00:22:55.667
<i>you hold in your heart?</i>

00:22:56.876 --> 00:23:08.346
<i>One day I want to be the palm
of your hand and catch your tears</i>

00:23:08.596 --> 00:23:20.441
<i>I want us to share the
same sorrows, the same air</i>

00:23:20.692 --> 00:23:26.281
<i>I'll point the prow of this departing ship</i>

00:23:26.531 --> 00:23:35.081
<i>Right your way with no hesitation</i>

00:23:35.331 --> 00:23:41.045
<i>Let's raise the mast in this sea of wind</i>

00:23:41.296 --> 00:23:46.843
<i>And set sail on these waves of clouds</i>

00:23:47.093 --> 00:23:52.599
<i>With the faraway stars for a compass</i>

00:23:52.849 --> 00:24:00.523
<i>I'll head beyond the horizon with you</i>

00:24:02.775 --> 00:24:05.028
<i>--Hmm, maybe "Greatest Fam"?
--Fam?</i>

00:24:05.278 --> 00:24:09.324
<i>Oh, Gisey. I'm trying to come up with
a new name for the Turan flagship.</i>

00:24:09.574 --> 00:24:12.160
-- <i>"Glorious--</i> "
<i>--You have some nerve!</i>

00:24:12.410 --> 00:24:14.996
<i>You insult the name of the
illustrious Turan flagship Lasas!</i>

00:24:15.246 --> 00:24:18.124
<i>But it's our ship now! "Fam is Number--"</i>

00:24:18.374 --> 00:24:20.877
<i>I refuse to accept it! The Lasas is the Lasas!</i>

00:24:21.127 --> 00:24:22.170
<i>"World of Fan,' u!</i>

00:24:22.420 --> 00:24:25.256
<i>--Hey! Are you even listening?!
--Oh, please calm down, Princess Millia!</i>

00:24:25.506 --> 00:24:28.134
<i>Hmm, I guess "Fam Fan Fan" would be best!</i>
